OL,3,GNEWSABin lorry fire prompts vape
OL,4,Adisposal warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bin lorry fire believed to have been
OL,7,Fsparked by a discarded vape has
OL,8,Fprompted a warning not to dispose of
OL,9,Fbattery-powered items in household
OL,10,Frubbish.
OL,12,FWokingham Borough Council said the fire
OL,13,Fwas spotted by the waste collection
OL,14,Fcrew, who drove the lorry back to the
OL,15,Fdepot and called Royal Berkshire Fire
OL,16,Fand Rescue Service.
OL,18,FThe crew dumped the load of smouldering
OL,19,Frubbish while firefighters put the fire
OL,20,Fout. A thermal imaging camera was then
OL,21,Fused to check for hotspots.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
