OL,3,GNEWSABin lorry fire prompts vape
OL,4,Adisposal warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said no-one was hurt in the
OL,7,Ffire, which happened on Tuesday, but
OL,8,Furged residents not to put batteries or
OL,9,Fbattery-powered items in their bins.
